{"completed": true, "response": "{\"understanding\":\"他现在在乎的不是尽快弄清这件事究竟是什么，而是在越来越被它牵住时，仍别让一次强烈的靠近把继续接近的余地封死。于是当前体验可以同时有反复停留、不断换角度触碰，也有一阵阵明显增强的投入；增强并没有自动变成结论。\",\"why_now\":{\"earlier_fact\":\"H1：他面对的事尚未定下来，而他在乎的是保留继续接近它的可能，不急着把它定成结论。\",\"bridge\":\"正因为要保留这种可能，他不必在每次感受增强时立刻决定它意味着什么；同一件事可以被反复触及、从不同位置重新经历，而较强的投入也仍容纳在未定状态里。\",\"current\":\"本段持续的反复、跨越较长范围的连贯，以及从较疏到较密、从弱到强又回落的变化，使这种未定不再像单纯迟疑，而像人在持续靠近同一件仍不愿封口的事：有时被牵得很紧，有时又收回来，但关切始终是让接近还能继续。\",\"without\":\"若没有H1，这些反复、扩张和力度起伏主要只能说明体验在持续并改变强度；有了H1，才有理由把它理解为‘投入可以增强，但仍不把可能性提前封死’，而不是把增强误作已经得到答案。\"},\"used\":[\"H1\"],\"new_history\":[\"他并非只有在感受较轻时才能维持未定；即使投入明显增强，他仍能让强烈的靠近与暂不下结论并存。\"],\"self_check\":{\"history_effective\":true,\"pseudo_cause\":false,\"music_as_external_fact\":false,\"generic\":false,\"note\":\"H1提供了具体的关切内容：保留继续接近的余地。当前音乐只用来塑造这种关切现在呈现出的反复、增强与回落，没有被当成外部回应或关系进展；新增事实是‘强烈投入与未定可以共存’，不是单纯说感受更深。\"}}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cc097bb2-9b4d-4926-bf6f-f308536538e5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T215332056676Z", "elapsed_seconds": 22.047, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T21:53:54.104341+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d22f361e210a8ef584ca243933801deef239d4a5508a5af67389d5780ef56206", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T215332056676Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "4836038fb083bdb1c9c75c67997d2fa8be60c62153debdb302cc53d17686eb11"}}}
